msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides a programmable curve for STABILIZE mode to allow "
"\"softening\" of the curve to provide smoother pilot control. This curve "
"is set by the ``IM_STB_COL_x`` parameters as shown in the graph below. "
"All other modes use the collective extremes and a straight line curve "
"that were setup above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-swashplate-setup.rst:197
